RocketLeague_Arena_Text_Official::
    .string "This is the ROCKET LEAGUE arena.\p"
    .string "Only serious challengers stand\n"
    .string "under these lights.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_AreYouReady::
    .string "Are you ready?$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ChampionRoomLocked::
    .string "The ROCKET LEAGUE CHAMPION\n"
    .string "is not receiving challengers yet.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_GiovanniAway::
    .string "The door is locked.\p"
    .string "GIOVANNI is away on\n"
    .string "important business.\p"
    .string "The ROCKET LEAGUE CHAMPION\n"
    .string "is not receiving challengers.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ChampionAwaits::
    .string "The ROCKET LEAGUE CHAMPION\n"
    .string "awaits you in the next room.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_PetrelIntro::
    .string "PETREL: BRUNO trusts his fists.\n"
    .string "I prefer getting inside heads!\p"
    .string "Let me show you what PSYCHIC\n"
    .string "POKéMON can do.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArcherIntro::
    .string "ARCHER: LANCE relies on dragons.\n"
    .string "I have studied their weakness.\p"
    .string "My FAIRY team is ready.\n"
    .string "Are you?$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArianaIntro::
    .string "ARIANA: AGATHA has her ghosts.\n"
    .string "I have the darkness they fear.\p"
    .string "Care to step into it?$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ProtonIntro::
    .string "PROTON: LORELEI has her ice.\n"
    .string "I have STEEL and a plan to break it!\p"
    .string "Let's see you stop us.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_PetrelDefeat::
    .string "Heh... You saw right through\n"
    .string "my mind games!$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArcherDefeat::
    .string "So discipline alone was not\n"
    .string "enough.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArianaDefeat::
    .string "Hmph.\n"
    .string "You are more polished than you look.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ProtonDefeat::
    .string "Tch!\n"
    .string "You made that take too long.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_PetrelPostBattle::
    .string "PETREL: Go on, then.\p"
    .string "I want to see how long that\n"
    .string "nerve of yours lasts.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArcherPostBattle::
    .string "ARCHER: The next opponent will\n"
    .string "not be so easily unsettled.\p"
    .string "Proceed.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArianaPostBattle::
    .string "ARIANA: Hmph.\p"
    .string "Keep that edge sharp.\n"
    .string "You'll need it.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ProtonPostBattle::
    .string "PROTON: Fine, you win.\p"
    .string "Don't expect the next fight to\n"
    .string "be polite.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_RazorPostBattle::
    .string "KARDINAL: You cut clean through\n"
    .string "my plan.\p"
    .string "Let's see you do it again.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_VexPostBattle::
    .string "SHION: Data point recorded.\p"
    .string "Your odds just became more\n"
    .string "interesting.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_NovaPostBattle::
    .string "MOJAY: That hit harder than\n"
    .string "I expected.\p"
    .string "No shame in recalibrating.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_KnellPostBattle::
    .string "ATTRYCE: You heard the bell\n"
    .string "and kept standing.\p"
    .string "Respect.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_MakoPostBattle::
    .string "MAKO: Not bad under pressure.\p"
    .string "The deep end is still ahead.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_SablePostBattle::
    .string "SABLE: Shadows favor the\n"
    .string "patient.\p"
    .string "Maybe they favor you too.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_JetPostBattle::
    .string "JET: Fast enough to catch me,\n"
    .string "huh?\p"
    .string "Then don't slow down now.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ViperPostBattle::
    .string "VIPER: You avoided the bite.\p"
    .string "Next time, the venom goes\n"
    .string "deeper.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ReceivedCoins::
    .string "{PLAYER} received 1,000 COINS\n"
    .string "as a ROCKET LEAGUE prize.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ReceivedTierOneCoins::
    .string "{PLAYER} received 1,500 COINS\n"
    .string "as a ROCKET LEAGUE prize.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ReceivedTierTwoCoins::
    .string "{PLAYER} received 2,000 COINS\n"
    .string "as a ROCKET LEAGUE prize.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ReceivedTierThreeCoins::
    .string "{PLAYER} received 3,000 COINS\n"
    .string "as a ROCKET LEAGUE prize.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_CoinPouchFull::
    .string "You can't hold more COINS.\p"
    .string "You couldn't receive the prize\n"
    .string "COINS.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_RazorIntro::
	.string "KARDINAL: You watch the attack.\nI watch the choice before it.\pTry keeping a secret from my\nPSYCHIC team!$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_RazorDefeat::
	.string "You chose a line I hadn't seen.$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_VexIntro::
	.string "SHION: Still judging strength by\nappearances? My FAIRY team\penjoys correcting that mistake.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_VexDefeat::
	.string "An unexpected outcome. I'll\nrevise my prediction.$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_NovaIntro::
	.string "MOJAY: Empty space? Look closer.\nMy GHOST team is already making\pitself at home under these\nlights!$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_NovaDefeat::
	.string "You didn't fall for our\ndisappearing act!$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_KnellIntro::
	.string "ATTRYCE: Hear the bell? That's\nour cue. My WATER team keeps\prolling until the final round!$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_KnellDefeat::
	.string "You weathered every round!$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_MakoIntro::
	.string "MAKO: Plenty of challengers look\ncalm on the surface. Let's see\pwhat happens under pressure.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_MakoDefeat::
	.string "You kept your head in deep\nwater.$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_SableIntro::
	.string "SABLE: You came looking for\nsomething exotic? My\pordinary-looking team has a few\nsurprises.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_SableDefeat::
	.string "You noticed what mattered.\nClever.$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_JetIntro::
	.string "JET: My team keeps its feet on\nthe ground. One clean opening,\pand we hit like a landslide!$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_JetDefeat::
	.string "You stopped us in our tracks!$"


RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ViperIntro::
	.string "VIPER: A little pressure, a\nlittle poison. I prefer a plan\pthat keeps working after the\nfirst hit.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ViperDefeat::
	.string "You cut off my plan before it\nspread!$"

